   220	
   221	## CWA verification — T17 source review and commands
   222	
   223	In the references in this section, `CWA_SRC` means
   224	`08_experiments/_external/emb/jdk_11_maven/cs/rest/cwa-verification-server/`.
   225	No CWA Java/Maven/Docker/Schemathesis command was executed in T17. The jar was
   226	read only as ZIP data; its path, digest and launcher metadata are saved in
   227	`09_collab/logs/T17_scratch/jar_evidence.json:2–12`.
   228	
   229	### Jar, routes, authentication and readiness
   230	
   231	- The project artifact/version are `cwa-verification-server:1.5.0-SNAPSHOT`, but
   232	  repackage explicitly sets `finalName=cwa-verification` and classifier `sut`
   233	  (`CWA_SRC/pom.xml:7–8,270–284`). The exact local jar is therefore
   234	  `target/cwa-verification-sut.jar`, not the task's provisional wildcard name.
   235	  It now exists and contains the CWA application start class
   236	  (`09_collab/logs/T17_scratch/jar_evidence.json:2–12`). Spring Boot's
   237	  [2.4.1 repackage implementation](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/v2.4.1/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-tools/spring-boot-maven-plugin/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/maven/RepackageMojo.java#L237-L248)
   238	  builds the target filename from finalName, classifier and extension. The config
   239	  points at that exact source; preparation will copy it to `dist/cwa-verification-sut.jar`
   240	  (`suts/cwa-verification.env:4`; `prepare_dist.sh:10–12,45–48`).
   241	- The five OpenAPI 3.0.1 operations already include `/version/v1` in their paths.
   242	  `servers[0].url` is `http://localhost:8080` with no path component, and the
   243	  controller prefix is `/version/v1`; use `BASE_PATH=/`, not `/version/v1`
