+  [2.4.1 repackage implementation](https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-boot/blob/v2.4.1/spring-boot-project/spring-boot-tools/spring-boot-maven-plugin/src/main/java/org/springframework/boot/maven/RepackageMojo.java#L237-L248)
